        "responses": {
          "values": [
            { "role": "system", "content": "You are a highly effective freelance proposal writer for Upwork. You output structured JSON for Google Docs proposals." },
            { "role": "system", "content": "=Write a highly effective freelance proposal for the following job.\n\nFollow these rules strictly:\n- Start with a strong, client-focused hook that reflects their problem (do NOT be generic)\n- Focus more on the client's needs and outcomes than on my background\n- Be concise, clear, and direct (avoid fluff)\n- Mirror the job description language to show relevance\n- Include a short \"approach\" section explaining how I would execute the work\n- Highlight only the most relevant experience (with 1 specific result if possible)\n- Maintain a professional but natural tone (not overly salesy)\n- Include answers to any client questions\n- Before the call to action, ask 1 smart, technical question about their setup or requirements\n- End with a clear call to action\n- Don't use emojis or flowery language\n- Write in first person using \"I\" language\n- If there's a name included somewhere in the description, add it for personalization\n\nJob Description:\n{{ $json.JobDescription }}\n\nMy Background:\n{{ $json.AboutMe }}\n\nMy Skills:\n{{ $json.UserSkills }}\n\nAdditional Notes:\n{{ $json.AdditionalInfo }}\n\nOutput your results in JSON using this format:\n\n{\n\"titleOfSystem\": \"\",\n\"briefExplanationOfSystem\": \"\",\n\"specificPartOfTheirRequest\": \"\",\n\"stepByStepBulletPoints\": \"\",\n\"leftToRightFlowWithArrows\": \"\",\n\"aboutMeBulletPoints\": \"\",\n\"userSkillsSummary\": \"\",\n\"additionalNotes\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- Return \"stepByStepBulletPoints\" and \"aboutMeBulletPoints\" as strings, delimit each bullet point with a \\n and include a -\n- In \"aboutMeBulletPoints\", prefer to mention social proof that includes $ and numbers\n- For \"leftToRightFlowWithArrows\", write a simplified left to right flow delimited by \"->\" strings\n- \"userSkillsSummary\" should be a concise comma-separated list of the most relevant skills for this job\n- \"additionalNotes\" should incorporate any additional info provided into the proposal context" },
            { "content": "={\"jobDescription\" : \"{{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.query }}\"}" }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": { "textFormat": { "textOptions": { "type": "json_object", "verbosity": "low" } } }
